# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Add entries here as pages move.

# The show directory lived at /podcasts, then at /shows as a standalone page.
# The Shows *feed* on the homepage replaced both, so each now lands on the feed
# itself rather than chaining /podcasts -> /shows -> nothing. Only the site page
# moves; the /api/v1/podcasts endpoints are a different path, unaffected.
#
# Both targets carry the fragment deliberately: the feed bar's controller reads
# the hash to pick which panel is on screen, so /#shows is the whole address.
/podcasts /#shows 301
/shows /#shows 301
